<title>USA: West Coast Bancorp names chairman.</title>
<headline>West Coast Bancorp names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Coast Bancorp said late Friday it has promoted Gary Putnam to the position of chairman.</p>
<p>Putnam was formerly vice chairman and succeeds Lester Green who has retired.</p>
</text>
